      Unused for now: AppTheme is a Material3 theme, which brings its own colour
      palette and derives the rest of the roles (containers, on-colours, ...)
      from it. Overriding only colorPrimary here would give a palette that no
      longer matches the derived roles.

      To brand the app, either override the full set of Material3 roles in
      AppTheme, or define a ThemeOverlay and apply it in AndroidManifest.xml.
      See https://m3.material.io/styles/color/roles
    -->
